{"step_index":480,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T06:34:33Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-04T00:34:33-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-04T00:34:35-06:00\nShowing lines 1-58 of 58\n1: @echo off\n2: setlocal ENABLEDELAYEDEXPANSION\n3: title ZTE-B866V2-OS12 [DESBLOQUEO + FLASHEO SEGURO + ANTI-WATCHDOG]\n4: chcp 65001 >nul\n5: cls\n6: cd /d \"%~dp0B866V2\"\n7: \n8: echo ============================================================================\n9: echo   ZTE B866V2 ANDROID 12 - DESBLOQUEO Y FLASHEO SEGURO (ANTI-WATCHDOG)\n10: echo ============================================================================\n11: echo [*] Esperando a que la caja entre en modo Fastboot por USB...\n12: \n13: :WAIT_FASTBOOT\n14: fastboot devices | findstr /i \"fastboot\" >nul\n15: if errorlevel 1 (\n16:     goto WAIT_FASTBOOT\n17: )\n18: \n19: echo [+] Caja detectada en Fastboot! Reteniendo conexion y ejecutando desbloqueo + OTG...\n20: fastboot oem \"watchdog off\"\n21: fastboot getvar version\n22: fastboot flashing unlock_critical\n23: fastboot flashing unlock\n24: fastboot oem \"setenv lock 10100000;save\"\n25: fastboot oem \"setenv otg_device 1;save\"\n26: fastboot oem \"setenv lock 10100000\"\n27: fastboot oem \"setenv otg_device 1\"\n28: fastboot oem \"saveenv\"\n29: fastboot getvar unlocked\n30: \n31: echo [*] Flasheando particiones de sistema Android 12 (protegiendo MAC/SN/Widevine)...\n32: fastboot flash boot boot.img\n33: fastboot flash bootloader bootloader.img\n34: fastboot flash _aml_dtb dtb.img\n35: fastboot flash dtbo dtbo.img\n36: REM SE OMITE factory.img y cri_data.img PARA NO BORRAR CLAVES DRM WIDEVINE L1 NI MAC/SN\n37: fastboot flash logo logo.img\n38: fastboot flash param param.img\n39: fastboot flash conf conf.img\n40: fastboot flash oem oem.img\n41: fastboot flash super super.img\n42: fastboot flash vbmeta vbmeta.img\n43: fastboot flash recovery recovery.img\n44: if exist \"..\\..\\..\\experimento\\11_VALIDACION_OTA_Y_FIRMWARE_ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\" (\n45:     fastboot flash cache \"..\\..\\..\\experimento\\11_VALIDACION_OTA_Y_FIRMWARE_ZTE\\cache_ext4.img\"\n46: ) else (\n47:     fastboot erase cache\n48: )\n49: fastboot erase userdata\n50: \n51: echo ============================================================================\n52: echo [+] PROCESO COMPLETADO. RETENIENDO CAJA EN FASTBOOT (ANTI-WATCHDOG ACTIVO)\n53: echo     La caja NO se reiniciara sola. Presiona Ctrl+C cuando desees salir.\n54: echo ============================================================================\n55: :KEEP_ALIVE\n56: fastboot getvar version >nul 2>&1\n57: timeout /t 2 /nobreak >nul\n58: goto KEEP_ALIVE\n(no newline at end of file)"}
{"step_index":481,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-04T06:34:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-04T00:34:34-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-04T00:34:35-06:00\nShowing lines 1-116 of 116\n1: @echo off\n2: chcp 65001 >nul\n3: title Flasheo Validado y Seguro ZTE B866V2 Android 12 (USB Macho-a-Macho Sin TTL)\n4: cls\n5: \n6: if /I \"%~1\"==\"--auto\" goto SKIP_VALIDATION\n7: \n8: echo ================================================================================\n9: echo   PASO 1: VALIDACION CRIPTOGRAFICA PREVIA DEL FIRMWARE B866V2 ANDROID 12\n10: echo ================================================================================\n11: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"%~dp0VALIDAR_FIRMWARE_Y_OTA_ZTE.ps1\"\n12: if errorlevel 1 (\n13:     echo [ERROR] La validacion previa fallo. Abortando por seguridad.\n14:     pause\n15:     exit /b 1\n16: )\n17: \n18: echo.\n19: echo ================================================================================\n20: echo   PASO 2: FLASHEO 100%% USB MACHO-A-MACHO (SIN TTL) + OTG + RECOVERY TV\n21: echo ================================================================================\n22: echo   - Conserva tus particiones 'factory' (Widevine L1 / HDCP) y 'cri_data' (MAC).\n23: echo   - Si la caja esta en Android con Depuracion USB (ADB), la envia sola a Fastboot.\n24: echo   - Desactiva el Hardware Watchdog (~14s) al instante de detectar Fastboot.\n25: echo   - Habilita permanentemente el puerto USB OTG (setenv otg_device 1;save).\n26: echo   - Instala recovery.img con menu completo desbloqueado en TV (Fastboot / ADB).\n27: echo   - Inyecta cache_ext4.img formateada con mke2fs para reparar /cache.\n28: echo ================================================================================\n29: echo.\n30: set /p CONFIRM=\"¿Deseas iniciar la espera activa para atrapar y flashear la caja por USB? (S/N): \"\n31: if /I not \"%CONFIRM%\"==\"S\" exit /b 0\n32: \n33: :SKIP_VALIDATION\n34: set \"SCRIPT_DIR=%~dp0\"\n35: cd /d \"%~dp0..\\..\\V2\\B866v2 Android 12\\B866v2 Android 12\\B866V2\"\n36: \n37: echo.\n38: echo [0/12] Verificando si la caja ya esta conectada en Android (ADB)...\n39: adb devices | findstr /r /c:\"de\n<truncated 939 bytes>\n_device 1;save\"\n63: fastboot oem \"setenv lock 10100000\"\n64: fastboot oem \"setenv otg_device 1\"\n65: fastboot oem \"saveenv\"\n66: fastboot reboot bootloader\n67: \n68: echo        Esperando reconexion del bootloader...\n69: :WAIT_FASTBOOT_2\n70: fastboot devices | findstr /r /c:\"fastboot\" >nul 2>&1\n71: if errorlevel 1 goto WAIT_FASTBOOT_2\n72: fastboot oem \"watchdog off\"\n73: fastboot flashing unlock_critical\n74: fastboot flashing unlock\n75: fastboot oem \"setenv lock 10100000;save\"\n76: fastboot oem \"setenv otg_device 1;save\"\n77: fastboot getvar unlocked\n78: \n79: echo [3/12] Flasheando boot.img (100%% Oficial ZTE verificado)...\n80: fastboot flash boot boot.img\n81: \n82: echo [4/12] Flasheando _aml_dtb y dtbo.img (100%% Oficial ZTE verificado)...\n83: fastboot flash _aml_dtb dtb.img\n84: fastboot flash dtbo dtbo.img\n85: \n86: echo [5/12] OMITIENDO factory.img y cri_data.img para conservar tu Widevine L1 y MAC originales...\n87: \n88: echo [6/12] Flasheando logo.img y param.img...\n89: fastboot flash logo logo.img\n90: fastboot flash param param.img\n91: \n92: echo [7/12] Flasheando conf.img y limpiando oem.img...\n93: fastboot flash conf conf.img\n94: fastboot flash oem oem.img\n95: \n96: echo [8/12] Flasheando super.img (Android 12 liberado)...\n97: fastboot flash super super.img\n98: \n99: echo [9/12] Flasheando vbmeta.img (Flags=0x03 dm-verity desactivado)...\n100: fastboot flash vbmeta vbmeta.img\n101: \n102: echo [10/12] Flasheando recovery.img (Menu Fastboot/ADB desbloqueado en TV para MarketCode 4301)...\n103: fastboot flash recovery recovery.img\n104: \n105: echo [11/12] Reparando particion /cache con superbloque ext4 valido (cache_ext4.img)...\n106: fastboot erase cache\n107: fastboot flash cache \"%SCRIPT_DIR%cache_ext4.img\"\n108: \n109: echo [12/12] Limpiando userdata y reiniciando...\n110: fastboot erase userdata\n111: fastboot reboot\n112: \n113: echo.\n114: echo [COMPLETADO] Tu caja Xview B866V2 se reiniciara en Android 12 con USB OTG (otg_device=1),\n115: echo              menu completo de Recovery en TV y particion /cache reparada.\n116: pause","truncated_fields":["content"]}
